t=E2=80=99s look at the key differences between them, focusing on performan=
ce and integration.</p> <h3 class=3D"relative group"><a id=3D"memory-manage=
ment-and-performance" class=3D"header-link block pr-1.5 text-lg no-hover:hi=
dden with-hover:absolute with-hover:p-1.5 with-hover:opacity-0 with-hover:g=
roup-hover:opacity-100 with-hover:right-full" href=3D"https://huggingface.c=
o/learn/llm-course/chapter2/8#memory-management-and-performance"><span><svg=
